9", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o3gSXbrPvUIQ7kNvwEzu3q8&_nc_oc=Adqihfwpi7kjpgG9UvOrOcv0U78pNgi9Jpb1IEaMhuvJHBkHe7L0CgDWPisQxPFRfx8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKrsFRMGqnQAAPyAIwUJ9t8CnCBo8E4QGGV5_g_bvBVYA&oe=6ABD0FDB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gE9idwW4OyIQ7kNvwEZsjSR&_nc_oc=AdoCSjR6FYKXTyvUq1AbklDk9oxZdRwlXWvORlXH2KpQC_OBcWcLpcRT0i0ItOCjT7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9KzkV54rb9Gz0WOOPIaUVGyxUo4vZeZD6subMrK9-WQ&oe=6ABD0F81"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Xac5JaO6pwQ7kNvwEd5HN_&_nc_oc=AdpiFigx_CtgV1ciTQZjFPRaa2uR_0H4PEdh_Uz-FSw54XZ54fkGLvQ6SDRnZFCXVvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIt1FdixjBhcmk1AXauOwCzq8ECqmqAsF6BoAhmB28MWw&oe=6ABD339D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CfCDHca_aIMQ7kNvwG6vsUP&_nc_oc=Adr56_6Vist9cHZ_MwTm63pk1Djp1KW51avg8nB9FznZ8INI8qFJmA838Uo5Yjeo6LM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK0g3J3qcxh1svZR-XAcsaGp4IUn7iJxuvAwWwTxjubYQ&oe=6ABD357F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jXXKTIFGaQQ7kNvwF5wSu7&_nc_oc=AdpZniYw_pvclAp5ZWYGp2FgLTE-bZq_t0274mkteF-9rts5LjTZuPnfSE8_l-4FkYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ9Tj6X1VKZUJqmibj02mI2p7NxeNqaT3BwLX--QRiVfQ&oe=6ABD29EE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OPiZT9uqiB4Q7kNvwG1W0sG&_nc_oc=AdqcJqQ6T8be71fMm4Mpi7FFzmGGoCEqoU1js3Rnhrb0cqc_YBGgwwse9YvuBhYHEuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLU4fVwVwgQsWFON4fR3bWu81t5WD_8hIPlLkzpVaUU2w&oe=6ABD22DF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L